CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around rings[i]
#614: FILE: include/linux/ptr_ring.h:439:
+		spin_lock_irqsave(&(rings[i])->consumer_lock, flags);

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

